## Extension points

Google OAuth and TOTP are intentionally not in the base. The auth layer keeps
the API and state boundaries needed for `auth:android-oauth` and
`auth:android-totp` overlays. Offline storage is also an overlay: add Room and
WorkManager behind the repository boundary rather than calling them from
features.
